# FinTech Logic: HFT Order Book & Idempotency
# Purpose: Low-latency matching engine structures and exactly-once processing helpers.

# ==========================================
# 1. Order Book (Limit Order)
# ==========================================
# We use Redis Sorted Sets to maintain the Order Book for AAPL.
# Score = Price.
# For BIDS: Higher score (price) is better.
# For ASKS: Lower score (price) is better.

# To handle Price-Time priority, we can encode timestamp into the score decimal
# or use Lexicographical ordering if prices are equal. 
# Simplified here: Score = Price.

# Buy Orders (Bids) - Highest Price First
# ZADD orderbook:AAPL:bids <price> <order_id>
ZADD orderbook:AAPL:bids 150.05 "ord_101"
ZADD orderbook:AAPL:bids 150.00 "ord_102"
ZADD orderbook:AAPL:bids 149.95 "ord_103"

# Sell Orders (Asks) - Lowest Price First
# ZADD orderbook:AAPL:asks <price> <order_id>
ZADD orderbook:AAPL:asks 150.10 "ord_201"
ZADD orderbook:AAPL:asks 150.15 "ord_202"

# Matching Logic (Pseudo-code for LUA script):
# 1. Incoming BUY at 150.12
# 2. Check Lowest ASK (ZRANGE orderbook:AAPL:asks 0 0 WITHSCORES) -> 150.10
# 3. 150.12 >= 150.10 -> MATCH!
# 4. Remove ord_201.
# 5. Remaining Qty checks next ASK...

# ==========================================
# 2. Real-Time Ticker Updates (Pub/Sub)
# ==========================================
# Push match events to connected UI clients via WebSockets
PUBLISH ticker:AAPL "{\"price\": 150.10, \"size\": 100, \"ts\": 167888...}"

# ==========================================
# 3. Idempotency Keys (API Safety)
# ==========================================
# prevent double-charging if a payment request times out but succeeds on server.
# Key: idempotency:<request_id>
# Val: Response Payload

# Client sends ReqID: req_555
SETNX idempotency:req_555 "PROCESSING"
# If Returns 1 -> Good, proceed.
# If Returns 0 -> Check status.

# ... Process Payment ...

SET idempotency:req_555 "{\"status\": \"SUCCESS\", \"tx_id\": \"tx_999\"}"
EXPIRE idempotency:req_555 86400 # Keep 24h

# ==========================================
# 4. OHLC (Candlestick) Data
# ==========================================
# TimeSeries module (or Redis Streams)
# XADD ticker:AAPL:raw * price 150.10 volume 100
XADD ticker:AAPL:raw * price 150.10 volume 100
